    "body": "BTW: I have tried to look at [HTTP Archive](https://httparchive.org/) data to see which `Content-Type` values are most commonly found in http responses.  I've shared the results in [a sheet here](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1lDorJzFizwgbLuTHL6-HZKTMXG67vlN8OB-ttjQ4ib0/edit?usp=sharing).\r\n\r\nI think we should consider adding more protection for the following types (ordered roughly in the order of how frequently they occur in the wild, with most common types listed first):\r\n- application/x-gzip\r\n- application/zip\r\n- application/x-protobuf\r\n- application/pdf\r\n- text/csv\r\n- application/msword",
