    "body": "I've just discovered the work happening here and I must say I'm enamored. Securing the web and the user space/s outside of the web *while* ensuring user privacy is essential. If I may suggest an additional MIME type for consideration: `application/pgp-signature`. As an outsider to this prospectively daunting task, I believe that such keys both public and private (in the rare cases when private keys are mistakenly exposed online), deserve the same privacy considerations as those types listed by @anforowicz. Thank-you all.",
